That last repayment is smaller because, by then,

50
00:01:45,619 --> 00:01:48,003
what's owed plus its interest is less than

51
00:01:48,024 --> 00:01:48,745
a full repayment.

52
00:01:49,522 --> 00:01:51,513
Here's a graph made the same way, for

53
00:01:51,594 --> 00:01:52,680
four different repayments.

54
