77
00:02:49,827 --> 00:02:52,590
from about seventy-nine years at seventeen hundred dollars

78
00:02:52,951 --> 00:02:54,813
to about thirty-six at two thousand.

79
00:02:55,616 --> 00:02:58,221
Far above it, the curve flattens, and extra

80
00:02:58,262 --> 00:02:59,785
money buys only a little time.

81
00:03:00,535 --> 00:03:02,959
Now keep the repayment at two thousand five

82
